flowchart LR
    Start([Daily 07:00 UTC]) --> R[Research]
    R -->|RSS + Reddit + Trends| G[Gemini 2.5 Flash]
    G -->|5 ideas, approve top 3| DB[(Supabase DB)]
    DB -->|Approved ideas| CG[Content Generation]
    CG -->|every 2h| DA[Design]
    DA -->|1080x1080 PNGs| IH[imgbb Hosting]
    IH -->|public URLs| PB{Publish}
    PB -->|08:00 / 14:00 / 20:00 UTC| IG[Instagram API]
    IG -->|30 min later| CR[Comment Reply]
    CR -->|every 2h| IG
    
    IG -->|weekly| AN[Analytics]
    AN -->|Sunday 20:00| FB[Feedback Loop]
    FB -.->|informs next research| R
    
    IG -->|weekly| RL[Reel Pipeline]
    RL -->|Sunday 16:00| IG
    
    TO[Token Refresh] -.->|monthly| IG
